15778 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Our Royal Cinnamon comes from the mountains of Quang Nam in\ncentral Vietnam\056 This area was historically famous for spicy\054 sweet\ncinnamon\054 but in the last decade\054 the commodity market has\nshifted further north\054 where the prices are lower\056 Everyone told us\nthat this area wasn\047t worth visiting and that their heirloom\ncinnamon variety wasn\047t being harvested anymore\056 We were very\nhappy to discover that\047s not the case \055 the cinnamon here IS being\nharvested\054 and is incredible\054 probably the most intense we\047ve ever\ntasted\056)
     /K [ 3287 ]
     /P 15779 0 R
     /Pg 9212 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

